{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまんとひひ⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まんとひひって猿だっけ。ゴリラだっけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベリってほんとに忘れ物ひどい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の部屋に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目薬とかメガネとか、お茶とか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりして!( ˙-˙ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最近お姉ちゃんだなって思うことがあったんですけど、忘れました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベリの二の腕すっごい気持ちいいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私的にはベリの手首を気づくと触ってます。( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか筋肉がなんにもなくて。手首折れそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFY39EKTNPBKPYE21EVRMJ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪分け目ちがう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}